{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "68ff2106-21f3-8ab8-9808-23fe7e8dc2a1",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:11:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diogo Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:06:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Priya. Diogo Raposo here. So, I'm calling because I apparently can't pay a water bill like a functioning adult. My payment bounced and I want to know where things stand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:06:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look into that. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "22 Eustis Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Give me a moment to pull up the account. [pause] Okay, I see it. There's a payment from your bank that was returned, and the water and sewer balance is showing as open again, sixty-two dollars and fifteen cents."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:07:11-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's the number. Here's my gripe. The money was in the account. I checked. So either the bank messed up or the payment got sent wrong, and now I'm the guy with the bounced payment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. From my side I can only see that it came back as returned. I can't see the bank's reason on this screen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:07:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course you can't. Okay. Is there a late fee on it now, or is it just sitting there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:07:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's showing as the original balance right now. If it stays unpaid past the due date, it can be assessed as late, so it's best to take care of it soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:08:06-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Can you email me a duplicate copy of the bill? The one I got in the mail is somewhere under a pile of holiday cards and takeout menus."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is there an email address on the account, or would you like to give me a new one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Use the one on file. I haven't changed it since, I don't know, the Obama years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:08:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, I'll send it to the one on file. It should arrive within a few minutes. Check your spam folder if it doesn't show."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Now, second thing. If I want to dispute this charge formally, how do I do that? Because I'd like it on record that I did pay once, and the bank is the one who dropped it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a formal dispute, you'd put it in writing to the utilities billing office, with your account information, the date of the payment, and what you believe went wrong. A bank statement showing the attempt helps. I can note on the account right now that you've called and are disputing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, please note it. I'll write the letter. I'm just going to pay it anyway so it doesn't snowball, and sort out the rest after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:09:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Would you like to pay by card now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:09:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, let me grab it. Sorry, I'm in a drugstore, I'm getting a passport photo taken in a minute, so if I look like a hostage in that picture, blame you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:10:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, take your time. Whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's 4012 8888 8888 1881, expiration 07/30."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me read that back: 4012, 8888, 8888, 1881, expiring July 2030, for sixty-two dollars and fifteen cents. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:10:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:10:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Processing now. [pause] It went through. You'll get a confirmation number, and the account will show the balance cleared. I've also put the dispute note on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And the duplicate bill is coming by email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:10:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm sending it right now, and the receipt will go along with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:11:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thanks, Priya. Sorry for grumbling at you, it's not your fault the bank's got a hobby of bouncing things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Hang on to the bank statement for your letter. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:11:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, that's it. They're calling my name for the photo. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:11:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Raposo. Good luck with the photo."
    }
  ],
